# Nothing listed here is needed to build or serve the site, and all of it was
# being uploaded on every deploy. The three question-bank JSONs alone are ~20MB,
# and data/ is another ~12MB.
#
# The bank lives in Supabase (bank_papers / bank_questions). These files are the
# import-time source of record for scripts/import-bank.ts, read from a
# developer's machine. They sit outside public/ so they are never served, and
# they have no reason to reach Vercel at all.
#
# Deliberately explicit rather than a blanket *.json: package.json,
# package-lock.json, components.json, tsconfig*.json and vercel.json are all
# load-bearing at build time, and excluding any of them breaks the deploy in a
# way that is tedious to diagnose from here -- we cannot read Vercel's logs.

# Every pattern here is root-anchored with a leading slash, deliberately.
# .vercelignore uses .gitignore syntax, where an unanchored `data/` matches at
# ANY depth -- so it would also have excluded src/data/, which nothing imports
# today but would be a silent, log-less build failure the day something did.
# Anchoring costs nothing and removes the trap.

# Question-bank sources and re-import inputs (~20MB + data/ another ~12MB)
/data/
/history_civics_bank.json
/question_bank_economics.json
/question_bank_english_partial.json

# Database migrations: applied via the Supabase CLI, never by the build
/supabase/
/*.sql

# Docs, handoff material and design archives
/docs/
/*.md
/*.zip
/maths_question_bank_deploy*
/Shikshok mobile design overhaul*

# Local-only
/tmp/
/run-dev.bat
